  "notes": "サポート is from English \"support.\" Widely used in business, technology, and service contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- サポート⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to support\n- サポート⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{受|う}ける→受ける：01215_ukeru⟧: to receive support\n- サポート⟦{体制|たいせい}→体制：04490_taisei⟧: support system/structure\n- テクニカルサポート: technical support\n- カスタマーサポート: customer support\n\nUSAGE:\nPrimarily used for practical/organizational support — help desks, assistance programs, technical aid. For emotional or moral support, native Japanese words are more natural.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{支援|しえん}→支援：07778_shien⟧: support, assistance (formal, institutional)\n- ⟦{応援|おうえん}→応援：01900_ouen⟧: cheering, moral support (encouragement)\n- ⟦{援助|えんじょ}→援助：01892_enjo⟧: aid, assistance (formal, often financial)\n- ⟦{手助|てだす}け→手助け：12769_tedasuke⟧: help, a helping hand (casual, practical)",
